<http://data.silknow.org/object/d16da19a-1df1-3694-a9da-b2087fa0a220>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Panel, made of two pieces sewn together. Roller (and block?)-printed tabby-woven cotton, glazed. On a brown ground patterned to resemble tree bark, a drop-repeated unit showing two violet and blue birds and a bouquet of lilies, primroses and morning-glories. Larger piece shows full loom width and has both selvedges; smaller piece has one selvedge. Hemmed top and bottom."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/f1d4dd44-8986-38ba-ae73-8421d0c48034> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/4b8d0cb1-213b-3c78-a153-1a96b5dce9db> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/db9d3bb0-ab69-37b6-aab4-8ef7430cae3a> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Panel, made of two pieces sewn together. Roller (and block?)-printed tabby-woven cotton, glazed. On a brown ground patterned to resemble tree bark, a drop-repeated unit showing two violet and blue birds and a bouquet of lilies, primroses and morning-glories. Larger piece shows full loom width and has both selvedges; smaller piece has one selvedge. Hemmed top and bottom."@en ;
